div.p:
At the reporters’ table were Messrs. Daniel Logan, editor of the Daily Herald;
                    Walter Hill, editor of the Bulletin; Alatau T. Atkinson, editor of the Gazette;
                    Messrs. Taylor and Gilbert, of the P. C. Advertiser; Mr. S. Kaaikaula, of the
                    Pae Aina; Mr. Ho Fon, of the Chinese News, and Mr. F. J. Testa, of the
                    Elele.
